{"students":{"7723214137":{"classrooms":["TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D"],"name":"Ozodaxon Maxamadismonova"},"1465352022":{"classrooms":["TOS-3SGX-IENT-9VI3"],"name":"Shaxzoda Olimova"},"8845531824":{"classrooms":["TOS-3SGX-IENT-9VI3"],"name":"Cristiano Ronaldo"}},"classrooms":{"TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D":{"teacher_id":"7957347033","students":["7723214137"],"name":"Sinf (TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D)"},"TOS-WQAF-NYFC-M7EH":{"teacher_username":"@ahrormamazok1rov","teacher_id":"7957347033","students":[],"name":"CEFR C1"},"TOS-AVM7-ABM6-LH2A":{"teacher_username":"@axror","teacher_id":"6315515792","students":[],"name":"CEFR C1"},"TOS-NPY8-RNQ6-WYA2":{"active_assignment":{"deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","classroomData":{"reorderItems":[{"correct":"He reads books every day.","words":["every","day","he","reads","books"]},{"words":["do","you","like","coffee"],"correct":"Do you like coffee?"},{"correct":"She does not eat meat.","words":["not","she","does","eat","meat"]}],"slides":[{"tag":"Slide 1: Kirish","title":"Present Simple nima?","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;'><h3 style='color: #38bdf8;'>Doimiy takrorlanadigan ish-harakatlar</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Present Simple — bu bizning kundalik odatlarimiz, umumiy haqiqatlar va doimiy holatlarni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan zamon.</p><div style='background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;'><b>Misol:</b> I drink coffee every morning. (Men har kuni ertalab qahva ichaman.)</div></div>"},{"title":"Tasdiq shakli (Affirmative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #6ee7b7;'>Formula: Subject + Verb (+s/es)</h3><ul style='color: #f1f5f9;'><li>I / You / We / They + <b>work</b></li><li>He / She / It + <b>works</b></li></ul><p style='color: #94a3b8;'>Eslatma: Uchinchi shaxs birlikda (He, She, It) fe'lga <b>-s</b> yoki <b>-es</b> qo'shiladi.</p></div>","tag":"Slide 2: Formula"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fb7185;'>Yordamchi fe'llar: do not / does not</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Inkor yasash uchun <b>do not (don't)</b> yoki <b>does not (doesn't)</b> ishlatamiz.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>I don't like apples.</b><br><b>She doesn't like apples.</b></div></div>","title":"Inkor shakli (Negative)","tag":"Slide 3: Inkor"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fbbf24;'>Do / Does gap boshiga chiqadi</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Savol berish uchun gap boshiga <b>Do</b> yoki <b>Does</b> qo'yiladi.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>Do you speak English?</b><br><b>Does he play football?</b></div></div>","title":"So'roq shakli (Interrogative)","tag":"Slide 4: So'roq"},{"tag":"Slide 5: Kalit so'zlar","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #a5b4fc;'>Present Simple'ni qanday aniqlaymiz?</h3><ul style='color: #e2e8f0;'><li>Always (har doim)</li><li>Usually (odatda)</li><li>Often (tez-tez)</li><li>Sometimes (ba'zida)</li><li>Every day (har kuni)</li></ul></div>","title":"Vaqt ko'rsatkichlari"},{"tag":"Slide 6: Xulosa","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;'><h3 style='color: #ffffff;'>Endi navbat sizga!</h3><p style='color: #cbd5e1;'>O'z kundalik odatlaringiz haqida 5 ta gap tuzing. Masalan: 'I wake up at 7 o'clock'.</p><button style='background: #6366f1; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;'>Mashqlarni boshlash</button></div>","title":"Amaliyot vaqti!"}],"questionsPrompt":"Ustozingizga 'Present Simple' mavzusida tushunmagan yoki qiziqtirgan kamida 2 ta savolingizni yozing.","blanks":[{"s":"She ______ (work) in a bank.","a":"works"},{"a":"play","s":"They ______ (play) tennis every Sunday."},{"s":"______ (do) he speak English?","a":"Does"},{"s":"I ______ (not/like) spicy food.","a":"do not like"},{"s":"The train ______ (arrive) at 9 AM.","a":"arrives"},{"s":"We ______ (visit) our grandparents often.","a":"visit"},{"a":"Do","s":"______ (do) you want some water?"},{"s":"He ______ (not/go) to the gym.","a":"does not go"},{"s":"My sister ______ (read) many books.","a":"reads"},{"s":"They ______ (live) in a big house.","a":"live"}],"deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","translations":[{"uz":"Men har kuni ertalab soat 7 da uyg'onaman.","hint":"(I, wake up, every morning, at 7)"},{"hint":"(He, know, English, well)","uz":"U (o'g'il bola) ingliz tilini yaxshi biladi."},{"uz":"Biz dam olish kunlari kinoga bormaymiz.","hint":"(We, not go, to the cinema, on weekends)"},{"uz":"Siz maktabda o'qiysizmi?","hint":"(Do, you, study, at school)"},{"uz":"Mening onam mazali ovqat pishiradi.","hint":"(My mother, cook, delicious food)"},{"uz":"Ular parkda yugurishni yoqtirishadi.","hint":"(They, like, running, in the park)"},{"uz":"U (qiz bola) har kuni kitob o'qiydi.","hint":"(She, read, a book, every day)"},{"uz":"Bizning mushugimiz sut ichmaydi.","hint":"(Our cat, not drink, milk)"},{"hint":"(Where, do, you, work)","uz":"Siz qayerda ishlaysiz?"},{"hint":"(They, have a rest, every summer)","uz":"Ular har yili yozda dam olishadi."}],"hwMcqs":[{"ans":"goes","opts":["go","goes","going","gone"],"q":"My brother ______ to school every morning.","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (he/she/it) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi."},{"expl":"Ko'plik shakli (they) uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","q":"They ______ English at the university.","opts":["study","studies","studying","studied"],"ans":"study"},{"ans":"Do","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"q":"______ you like apples?","expl":"You olmoshi bilan so'roq gaplarda 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi."},{"q":"She ______ not play football.","expl":"Inkor gaplarda uchinchi shaxs birlik uchun 'does not' ishlatiladi.","ans":"does","opts":["do","does","is","are"]},{"expl":"Birlikdagi shaxs uchun 'to be' fe'lining 'is' shakli qo'llaniladi.","q":"My father ______ a doctor.","ans":"is","opts":["be","am","is","are"]},{"ans":"eat","opts":["eat","eats","eating","eaten"],"expl":"We (biz) ko'plikda bo'lgani uchun fe'lga qo'shimcha qo'shilmaydi.","q":"We ______ breakfast at 8 o'clock."},{"expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (she) uchun so'roq gap 'does' bilan boshlanadi.","q":"______ she live in Tashkent?","ans":"Does","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"]},{"opts":["do","does","doing","done"],"ans":"do","expl":"I (men) olmoshi uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","q":"I ______ my homework every evening."},{"ans":"rises","opts":["rise","rises","rising","risen"],"q":"The sun ______ in the east.","expl":"Tabiat hodisalari va doimiy faktlar uchun uchinchi shaxs birlikda -s qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi."},{"q":"They ______ not watch TV at night.","expl":"They (ular) ko'plik olmoshi bo'lgani uchun inkor gapda 'do not' ishlatiladi.","ans":"do","opts":["do","does","is","are"]}],"enrolledStudents":[],"errors":["He play football every day -> ✅ He plays football every day (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","Do she like coffee? -> ✅ Does she like coffee? (She uchun 'do' emas, 'does' ishlatiladi)","I goes to school. -> ✅ I go to school. (I olmoshi bilan fe'lga -es qo'shilmaydi)","They not work here. -> ✅ They do not work here. (Inkor gapda 'do' yordamchi fe'li shart)","She do not speak Uzbek. -> ✅ She does not speak Uzbek. (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda 'does' ishlatiladi)","We likes pizza. -> ✅ We like pizza. (We ko'plik bo'lgani uchun -s qo'shimchasi kerak emas)","Does you live in Tashkent? -> ✅ Do you live in Tashkent? (You uchun 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi)","He study English. -> ✅ He studies English. (y harfi bilan tugagan fe'llarda -ies qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi)","My brother eat apple. -> ✅ My brother eats an apple. (Birlikdagi shaxs uchun fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","They is happy. -> ✅ They are happy. (Ko'plik uchun 'is' emas, 'are' ishlatiladi)"],"topic":"Present Simple","rules":[{"desc":"He, She, It olmoshlari bilan fe'lga -s yoki -es qo'shiladi.","title":"Uchinchi shaxs qoidasi","examples":["He reads a book.","She watches TV."]},{"examples":["Does he work? (not works)","He doesn't work."],"title":"Inkor va so'roqda o'zgarish","desc":"Does ishlatilganda fe'ldagi -s/-es tushib qoladi."}],"flashcards":[{"uzEx":"Men har doim o'qiyman.","pos":"Adverb","enEx":"I always study.","word":"Always","uz":"Har doim"},{"enEx":"I usually sleep early.","uz":"Odatda","word":"Usually","uzEx":"Men odatda erta uxlayman.","pos":"Adverb"},{"word":"Drink","uz":"Ichmoq","enEx":"They drink water.","pos":"Verb","uzEx":"Ular suv ichishadi."},{"uz":"Ishlamoq","word":"Work","enEx":"He works hard.","pos":"Verb","uzEx":"U qattiq ishlaydi."},{"uzEx":"Biz shaxmat o'ynaymiz.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"We play chess.","word":"Play","uz":"O'ynamoq"},{"uzEx":"Men har kuni yuguraman.","pos":"Phrase","enEx":"I run every day.","uz":"Har kuni","word":"Every day"},{"uzEx":"U mushuklarni yoqtiradi.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"She likes cats.","word":"Like","uz":"Yoqtirmoq"},{"uzEx":"U maktabga boradi.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"He goes to school.","uz":"Bormoq","word":"Go"},{"uzEx":"Ular ingliz tilini o'rganishadi.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"They study English.","uz":"O'qimoq","word":"Study"},{"enEx":"I eat lunch at 1pm.","uz":"Yemoq","word":"Eat","uzEx":"Men tushlikni soat 1 da yeyman.","pos":"Verb"},{"uzEx":"Biz Toshkentda yashaymiz.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"We live in Tashkent.","word":"Live","uz":"Yashamoq"},{"uz":"O'qimoq","word":"Read","enEx":"He reads news.","pos":"Verb","uzEx":"U yangiliklarni o'qiydi."}],"teacherUsername":"@axror","level":"A1","essayPrompt":"O'zingizning kundalik tartibingiz haqida 8-10 ta gap yozing. Har kuni nimalar qilishingizni tasvirlab bering. Masalan: soat nechida uyg'onasiz, nimalar yeyishni yoqtirasiz, maktabga qanday borasiz va bo'sh vaqtingizda nimalar bilan shug'ullanasiz. 'Present Simple' qoidalariga rioya qiling. Gaplaringizni 'I wake up...', 'I eat...', 'I go...' kabi boshlang. O'zingizning maqsadlaringiz haqida ham yozib o'ting. Matnni xatosiz yozishga harakat qiling.","name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","teacherName":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","quiz":[{"opts":["go","goes","going","gone"],"ans":"goes","q":"She ___ to school every day.","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (She) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shiladi."},{"ans":"Do","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"expl":"You olmoshi bilan 'Do' ishlatiladi.","q":"___ you like pizza?"},{"expl":"He uchun inkor shakli 'does not' bo'ladi.","q":"He ___ not play football.","ans":"does","opts":["do","does","is","are"]},{"q":"They ___ English well.","expl":"They ko'plik bo'lgani uchun fe'l o'zgarmaydi.","ans":"speak","opts":["speak","speaks","speaking","to speak"]},{"expl":"She uchun savol 'Does' bilan boshlanadi.","q":"___ she live in London?","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"ans":"Does"},{"ans":"drink","opts":["drink","drinks","drinking","drank"],"expl":"I olmoshi bilan fe'l o'zgarmaydi.","q":"I ___ coffee in the morning."}],"teacherChatId":"6315515792","roomKey":"TOS-NPY8-RNQ6-WYA2"},"topic":"Present Simple","level":"A1","roomHash":"N4IgTg9hC2DSCmBPEAuEAVA8gZQLQDkAFATQA5cAlfARQDZcB1YgQQCYQAaEAOwENp4qEMV7cA5gEsABNgncAZlIAMtAPQBGJatZLWtTiAAu8XgGMAFvDD5+gtCPHTZC5Ws3bd+roYgAHCaZChGDwAM7w3IYyEtC+ADaCXAkAbvBxQszqBsZmlmAAquFgfAJCAAK8AB6QYNkmFlYAwua8hgCSACZCtADM6gCs--Dq8PZfKTnV28MAGzPQhbQOuGqQtACOEmbFbAUmSvCkHX10Eb5h5HZztvk5Yt9qkCws-1t9othgkFtu1u4Ukz-Ag3BRHt8ktu90efven1MPz+AKBIPBoyRUk0rGhrDhyJRrCxOLxBLEjKULNTNlKVwBJ5EMIEYS5UIeX2AVeloWh5HUbUrhOcUAFk7R5FAPTQqQ2l7KtuFLRV5HkeB4CkeBUjAI1oDZHNxBRKQwXQiIm0rfN-mkKwTQtE4pHbcxu1tCx+FEFF0Q9Q9JVUGTsgkQwEiCEJwkieN4konNoF4AB+bJeDEIRsF5Sj1CBWAJCre0QAAXw4UATSMtATP2SjWCBAAxNl6wtAwzguIQbjuX15TPC8IELa9QV4CEoVheEpERN8MWxXF8VzIl-1JQD2SpGlbnpRlmVJCUpRlY95UDYN+VoCjhhOYZtW8sBfN4IFsAWE4ACt4FMKIAGopAANSsASwQG0JVDCKTPR6SUFjiUL--nBc58V67J2eWM3xfl958V53MRd+CzWX5cPNOdJBORcB8Xw-wAzuNojXh5FMFC0IIhel6kEtKN4L4TSoRZZoVQmASUaE6aUV3r