nts":[]},"TOS-PY23-9CNY-6J45":{"teacher_username":"@axror","teacher_id":"7957347033","name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","students":[]},"TOS-H2V3-KNXT-VGFU":{"name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","students":[],"teacher_id":"6315515792","teacher_username":"@axror","active_assignment":{"classroomData":{"rules":[{"examples":["I had been working all day.","They had been playing football for two hours."],"desc":"Bu zamon faqat harakatning qancha vaqt davom etganini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi.","title":"Davomiylik qoidasi"},{"examples":["I had known him for years (NOT: I had been knowing).","She had loved him since childhood."],"desc":"Holat fe'llari (know, like, believe, love) odatda -ing shaklida ishlatilmaydi.","title":"Statik fe'llar bilan ishlatilmaslik"}],"flashcards":[{"uzEx":"U yugurayotgan edi.","pos":"Auxiliary verb","enEx":"He had been running.","uz":"bo'lgan edi (davomiy)","word":"Had been"},{"uzEx":"Soat 5 dan beri.","pos":"Preposition","enEx":"Since 5 PM.","word":"Since","uz":"-dan beri"},{"uz":"davomida","word":"For","enEx":"For two hours.","pos":"Preposition","uzEx":"Ikki soat davomida."},{"uz":"davomiylik","word":"Duration","enEx":"The duration was long.","pos":"Noun","uzEx":"Davomiyligi uzoq edi."},{"enEx":"The action started early.","word":"Action","uz":"harakat","uzEx":"Harakat erta boshlandi.","pos":"Noun"},{"uzEx":"Men ketishimdan oldin.","pos":"Conjunction","enEx":"Before I left.","word":"Before","uz":"oldin"},{"pos":"Adjective","uzEx":"Davomiy yomg'ir.","uz":"davomiy","word":"Continuous","enEx":"Continuous rain."},{"enEx":"Perfect timing.","uz":"mukammal","word":"Perfect","uzEx":"Mukammal vaqt.","pos":"Adjective"},{"uz":"zamon","word":"Tense","enEx":"Past tense.","pos":"Noun","uzEx":"O'tgan zamon."},{"pos":"Noun","uzEx":"Vaqtga urg'u.","word":"Emphasis","uz":"urg'u","enEx":"Emphasis on time."},{"uzEx":"Natija aniq edi.","pos":"Noun","enEx":"The result was clear.","word":"Result","uz":"natija"},{"word":"Process","uz":"jarayon","enEx":"The process is slow.","pos":"Noun","uzEx":"Jarayon sekin."}],"teacherUsername":"@axror","level":"B1","essayPrompt":"O'tgan yili erishgan maqsadlaringiz yoki hayotingizdagi biror davr haqida yozing. 'Past Perfect Continuous' zamonidan foydalanib, biror muhim voqea sodir bo'lishidan oldin nimalar bilan band bo'lganingizni tasvirlang. Masalan, imtihonga tayyorgarlik ko'rganingiz, sport bilan shug'ullanganingiz yoki chet tilini o'rganganingiz haqida yozishingiz mumkin. Matningiz kamida 8-10 ta gapdan iborat bo'lsin. Har bir gapda o'sha davrda qancha vaqt davomida nima qilayotganingizni aniq ko'rsating. Bu sizning o'tgan zamondagi jarayonlarni qanchalik yaxshi tushunganingizni tekshirishga yordam beradi.","name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","teacherName":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","quiz":[{"expl":"O'tgan zamondagi boshqa harakatdan oldingi davomiylik uchun Past Perfect Continuous ishlatiladi.","q":"I ____ for two hours before he called.","ans":"had been waiting","opts":["had been waiting","was waiting","have been waiting","waited"]},{"q":"She ____ English since she was a child.","expl":"Since so'zi davomiylikni bildiradi.","opts":["had been learning","was learning","learned","has been learning"],"ans":"had been learning"},{"q":"They ____ for a long time before they found the house.","expl":"O'tgan zamondagi voqeadan oldingi davomiy harakat.","ans":"had been driving","opts":["had been driving","were driving","drove","have been driving"]},{"q":"Had you ____ before the meeting started?","expl":"So'roq gapda had + subject + been + V-ing shakli ishlatiladi.","opts":["been working","worked","working","been work"],"ans":"been working"},{"expl":"Inkor shaklida 'had not been' ishlatiladi.","q":"He ____ (not) ____ for the exam, so he failed.","ans":"hadn't been studying","opts":["hadn't been studying","wasn't studying","didn't study","hasn't been studying"]},{"expl":"To'g'ri formula: had + been + V-ing.","q":"Which sentence is correct?","opts":["I had been reading.","I had reading.","I been reading.","I had been read."],"ans":"I had been reading."}],"teacherChatId":"6315515792","roomKey":"TOS-H2V3-KNXT-VGFU","reorderItems":[{"correct":"I had been reading for two hours.","words":["had","been","I","reading","hours","for","two"]},{"words":["been","they","Had","all","working","day"],"correct":"Had they been working all day?"},{"correct":"She had not been feeling well.","words":["not","been","She","had","well","feeling"]}],"questionsPrompt":"Ustozingizga 'Past Perfect Continuous' mavzusida tushunmagan yoki qiziqtirgan kamida 2 ta savolingizni yozing.","slides":[{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;'><h3 style='color: #38bdf8;'>O'tgan zamonda davomiy harakat</h3><p style='color: #f1f5f9;'>Past Perfect Continuous (o'tgan mukammal davomiy zamon) o'tgan zamonda boshlanib, yana bir o'tgan zamon harakatigacha davom etgan jarayonni ifodalaydi.</p><div style='background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8;'><b>Misol:</b> I had been waiting for an hour when the bus finally arrived.</div></div>","title":"Past Perfect Continuous nima?","tag":"Slide 1: Kirish"},{"title":"Grammatik tuzilma","body":"<div style='background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h2 style='color: #6ee7b7;'>Subject + had been + V-ing</h2><ul style='color: #e2e8f0;'><li><b>Darak:</b> She had been studying.</li><li><b>Inkor:</b> She had not (hadn't) been studying.</li><li><b>So'roq:</b> Had she been studying?</li></ul></div>","tag":"Slide 2: Formula"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(165, 180, 252, 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><p style='color: #f8fafc;'>Biz bu zamonni o'tgan zamondagi biror voqea sodir bo'lgunga qadar davom etgan harakatni ta'kidlash uchun ishlatamiz.</p><p style='color: #a5b4fc;'><b>Diqqat:</b> Natijaga emas, jarayonning davomiyligiga urg'u beriladi.</p></div>","title":"Qachon ishlatamiz?","tag":"Slide 3: Ishlatilish o'rni"},{"tag":"Slide 4: Kalit so'zlar","title":"Vaqt ko'rsatkichlari","body":"<div style='background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><p style='color: #fda4af;'>Past Perfect Continuous ko'pincha quyidagi so'zlar bilan keladi:</p><ul style='color: #f8fafc;'><li><b>For</b> (bir necha soat davomida)</li><li><b>Since</b> (soat nechalardan beri)</li><li><b>Before</b> (biror narsadan oldin)</li><li><b>When</b> (biror narsa sodir bo'lganda)</li></ul></div>"},{"tag":"Slide 5: Farqi","title":"Past Continuous vs Past Perfect Continuous","body":"<div style='background: rgba(253, 224, 71, 0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><p style='color: #fef08a;'><b>Past Continuous:</b> O'tgan zamonda shunchaki davom etayotgan harakat (I was sleeping).</p><p style='color: #fef08a;'><b>Past Perfect Continuous:</b> O'tgan zamondagi boshqa harakatgacha bo'lgan davomiylik (I had been sleeping for 2 hours before he woke me up).</p></div>"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;'><h3 style='color: #ffffff;'>Tayyormisiz?</h3><p style='color: #cbd5e1;'>Endi mashqlarni bajarish orqali bilimlaringizni mustahkamlang!</p><button style='background: #38bdf8; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; color: #000; font-weight: bold;'>Mashqlarni boshlash</button></div>","title":"Amaliyot vaqti","tag":"Slide 6: Xulosa"}],"blanks":[{"s":"He ______ (work) for the company for ten years before he retired.","a":"had been working"},{"s":"They ______ (talk) for an hour when I interrupted them.","a":"had been talking"},{"s":"______ (you / wait) long before the taxi arrived?","a":"Had you been waiting"},{"a":"had not been sleeping","s":"She ______ (not / sleep) well for several days."},{"s":"We ______ (study) for the exam all night.","a":"had been studying"},{"s":"The dog ______ (bark) for twenty minutes before the owner came out.","a":"had been barking"},{"a":"had been looking","s":"I ______ (look) for my keys for ages before I found them."},{"a":"Had it been snowing","s":"______ (it / snow) for a long time before you left?"},{"s":"They ______ (play) video games until their mother told them to stop.","a":"had been playing"},{"s":"He ______ (try) to fix the computer for hours.","a":"had been trying"}],"deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","translations":[{"hint":"(wait for two hours)","uz":"Men uchrashuvga kelganimda, ular ikki soatdan beri kutishayotgan edi."},{"hint":"(live in a rented house for five years)","uz":"Ular uyni sotib olishdan oldin besh yil davomida ijarada turishgan edi."},{"hint":"(how long work)","uz":"Sen u yerga yetib borganingda, u qancha vaqtdan beri ishlayotgan edi?"},{"hint":"(fix the car)","uz":"Biz mashinani tuzatayotganimizda qo'llarimiz kir bo'lib ketdi."},{"hint":"(talk on the phone)","uz":"U telefonda gaplashayotgan edi, shuning uchun eshigimni taqillatganimni eshitmadi."},{"hint":"(train for an hour)","uz":"O'yin boshlanguniga qadar futbolchilar bir soat mashq qilishayotgan edi."},{"hint":"(rain since morning)","uz":"Ular o'sha kuni ertalabdan beri yomg'ir yog'ayotgan edi."},{"hint":"(read a book)","uz":"Men kitob o'qiyotgan edim, shuning uchun vaqt qanday o'tganini bilmay qoldim."},{"uz":"Ular ko'p yillardan beri birga ishlashayotgan edi.","hint":"(work together for many years)"},{"hint":"(what do)","uz":"Siz u yerga borganingizda u nima qilayotgan edi?"}],"hwMcqs":[{"q":"By the time the teacher arrived, the students ______ for twenty minutes.","expl":"O'tgan zamonda ma'lum bir vaqtgacha davom etgan harakatni ifodalash uchun 'had been + verb-ing' ishlatiladi.","ans":"had been waiting","opts":["had been waiting","waited","have been waiting","were waiting"]},{"q":"She was tired because she ______ all day.","expl":"Harakatning o'tgan zamondagi natijasi (charchoq) uning uzoq vaqt davom etganligini ko'rsatadi.","ans":"had been working","opts":["had worked","had been working","has been working","works"]},{"ans":"had you been running","opts":["had you been running","did you run","have you been running","were you running"],"q":"How long ______ before the rain started?","expl":"Savol o'tgan zamondagi boshqa harakatdan oldin davom etgan jarayon haqida ketmoqda."},{"opts":["had been standing","stood","have been standing","are standing"],"ans":"had been standing","q":"They ______ for hours when the bus finally appeared.","expl":"Harakat avtobus kelgunga qadar davom etgan, shuning uchun Past Perfect Continuous kerak."},{"opts":["had been studying","studied","has studied","studies"],"ans":"had been studying","q":"He ______ English for three years before he moved to London.","expl":"Ko'chib o'tishdan oldin davom etgan jarayonni ifodalash uchun ushbu zamon ishlatiladi."},{"ans":"had been smoking","opts":["had been smoking","smoked","has been smoking","smokes"],"expl":"O'tgan zamondagi hid (natija) oldinroq davom etgan harakatdan kelib chiqqan.","q":"I could smell smoke because someone ______ in the room."},{"opts":["had been raining","rained","has been raining","rains"],"ans":"had been raining","expl":"Yomg'ir tun bo'yi davom etgan va bu o'tgan zamondagi holatning sababidir.","q":"The ground was wet because it ______ all night."},{"opts":["had been applying","applied","has been applying","applies"],"ans":"had been applying","expl":"Intervyugacha bo'lgan davrda muntazam ravishda qilingan harakatni bildiradi.","q":"She ______ for the job for months before she got an interview."},{"q":"We ______ for the concert for a long time when it was cancelled.","expl":"Konsert bekor qilingunga qadar tayyorgarlik jarayoni davom etgan.","opts":["had been preparing","prepared","have been preparing","prepare"],"ans":"had been preparing"},{"expl":"O'tgan zamondagi holatning sababini so'rash uchun Past Perfect Continuous ishlatiladi.","q":"Why were your eyes red? ______?","opts":["Had you been crying","Did you cry","Have you been crying","Are you crying"],"ans":"Had you been crying"}],"enrolledStudents":[],"errors":["She was working for 2 hours when I called -> She had been working for 2 hours when I called (O'tgan zamondagi ikki harakat ketma-ketligida davomiy harakat uchun Past Perfect Continuous ishlatiladi)","I have been waiting for an hour when he arrived -> I had been waiting for an hour when he arrived (O'tgan zamon kontekstida 'have' emas, 'had' ishlatiladi)","They had waiting for the bus all morning -> They had been waiting for the bus all morning (Past Perfect Continuous formulasida 'been' so'zi tushib qolmasligi kerak)","He had been sleep for 10 hours -> He had been sleeping for 10 hours (Fe'lga -ing qo'shimchasi qo'shilishi shart)","We had been play football before it started to rain -> We had been playing football before it started to rain (Fe'lning davomiy shakli -ing bilan yasaladi)","She had been study English for years -> She had been studying English for years (Study fe'li -ing shaklida yozilishi kerak)","I had been cook dinner when the lights went out -> I had been cooking dinner when the lights went out (Cook fe'li -ing shaklida bo'lishi kerak)","They had been run for a long time -> They had been running for a long time (Run fe'li -ing shaklida ikkita 'n' bilan yoziladi)","Had you been eat before the party? -> Had you been eating before the party? (Eat fe'li -ing shaklida bo'lishi kerak)","She had been not working hard -> She had not been working hard (Inkor shaklida 'not' so'zi 'had' va 'been' orasida keladi)"],"topic":"Past Perfect Continuous"},"deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","topic":"Past Perfect Continuous","level":"B1","roomHash":"-JacIIkiqIYtiuKZASRIkuSkwqNSGhskyUiEDSbLMiyGjcry-KCmIipKCqUgSlKuB5PIRhEjSWphDqlwGqQ7qet6FrQqC5oALISLROQoKm7FSIMh56qC8ArFIADuPASHWYhSB+O5BhYmQ7hJVjtkYVjEY28hyF+OTxkeYDwvAwx-moQGWhZ8LmhUPBiII2C6vAUgaESsDbtxFggAAvuwtz2Y5zkoUSTBqp2y5ghCUIgLC8JZqBmJmDieJQcSpI8GSUzUoQpDUjShAYZyPJ8gKcj4ShhFisRaqkbKcIKq5ypiqxFiEAlDpok6OQugaKhibMoKzD62BpKCd7VlIADUwnEWJ7YzcQuDlambWWmkfYgZ13W9fq8CEPAbLyEoPrQhclrsQAIo+WJ8WoAnYFp-QifNto7Ig5XmedZ0SBd5qDFwWIuvx5oyE9-J-BAkRks9XD+uOoniRE7